{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01080",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.96,
      "end_seconds": 6.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.11,
      "end_seconds": 13.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.08,
      "end_seconds": 23.46,
      "duration_seconds": 8.38,
      "text": "It's a tight band around my head. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.08,
      "end_seconds": 27.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Right, how many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.46,
      "end_seconds": 31.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "about... well, about three months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.48,
      "end_seconds": 35.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.59,
      "end_seconds": 42.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly. So, I've also had tired eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.6,
      "end_seconds": 51.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "And what about blurred vision, sickness or sensitivity to light?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.49,
      "end_seconds": 57.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "No, no blurred vision, sickness or sensitivity to light."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.42,
      "end_seconds": 62.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Have you had weakness, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.84,
      "end_seconds": 65.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "No, no weakness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.54,
      "end_seconds": 75.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.22,
      "end_seconds": 79.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "No, um, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.39,
      "end_seconds": 83.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.95,
      "end_seconds": 86.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "nothing unusual, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.32,
      "end_seconds": 89.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.5,
      "end_seconds": 99.84,
      "duration_seconds": 9.34,
      "text": "Erm, um, I have acid reflux, for about ten years. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.18,
      "end_seconds": 116.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "So, are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.77,
      "end_seconds": 120.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.55,
      "end_seconds": 123.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "what's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.0,
      "end_seconds": 129.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.03,
      "end_seconds": 136.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Alright, have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.73,
      "end_seconds": 143.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Hmm, yes, grass pollen, it gives me itchy eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.97,
      "end_seconds": 157.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.29,
      "end_seconds": 161.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "No, you know, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.24,
      "end_seconds": 167.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.45,
      "end_seconds": 175.97,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "Pantoprazole. I take it 40 milligrams, before breakfast. Paracetamol, 1 gram, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.78,
      "end_seconds": 180.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.9,
      "end_seconds": 184.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "My brother has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.78,
      "end_seconds": 191.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.57,
      "end_seconds": 204.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "nearly done with the readings.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.45,
      "end_seconds": 221.87,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 122 over 79, heart rate 70, temperature 36.4, saturation 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.0,
      "end_seconds": 227.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "let me look at the area, I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.75,
      "end_seconds": 231.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.97,
      "end_seconds": 254.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "Your neck and shoulder muscles are tight, and your eye movements are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.0,
      "end_seconds": 273.02,
      "duration_seconds": 16.02,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. So, based on the history and the examination, the most likely explanation is tension-type headache. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.49,
      "end_seconds": 308.81,
      "duration_seconds": 23.32,
      "text": "I'm gonna order an eye test, for eye strain. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Take screen breaks every hour and try regular neck stretches. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the headache becomes sudden and severe. Book a review in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.44,
      "end_seconds": 313.14,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.94,
      "end_seconds": 320.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.53,
      "end_seconds": 326.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.65,
      "end_seconds": 331.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.37,
      "end_seconds": 336.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}